# Validation first

Before running a workflow, confirm required inputs exist and are usable. Fail early with an informative error. No silent failures, swallowed exceptions, or unchecked assumptions.

Check as relevant: paths (exist, readable, non-empty); required metadata columns; sample-ID overlap; table shape; tool versions; writable outputs.

Ordinary fail-early validation — not adversarial, fuzz, or security testing.
